@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Me";
}

<div class="container">

    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h1>About Me</h1>
        <hr class="w-25 mx-auto">
    </div>

    <div class="row">

        <div class="col-lg-12">

            <h3>Biography</h3>

            <p class="about-text">
                Hello! My name is Gio Fernandez, and I am currently a student at Lyceum of Alabang.
                I am pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Information Technology (BSIT), a choice driven by my fascination with technology and how it shapes our daily lives.
                Throughout my educational journey, I have been dedicated to building a solid foundation in tech concepts, and this course is providing me with the practical skills and knowledge needed to thrive in the digital age.
            </p>

            <p class="about-text">
                Looking ahead, my ultimate career goal is to become a highly skilled IT professional, capable of tackling complex technological challenges.
                I am naturally curious, and one of my biggest interests is simply learning new things—whether that means picking up a new programming language or exploring how different systems work.
                When I am not studying, I love to unwind by playing chess and video games, both of which keep my strategic thinking sharp.
                Ultimately, my future plan is to secure a great job in the tech industry where I can grow professionally, while also making sure I take the time to truly enjoy life.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="row mt-5">

        <div class="col-md-6">

            <div class="card shadow h-100">

                <div class="card-body">

                    <h4 class="card-title">
                        Educational Background
                    </h4>

                    <ul>
                        <li>Lyceum Of Alabang</li>
                        <li>BSIT</li>
                        <li>3rd Year</li>
                    </ul>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6">

            <div class="card shadow h-100">

                <div class="card-body">

                    <h4 class="card-title">
                        Career Goals & Interests
                    </h4>

                    <ul>
                        <li>Be an IT Professional</li>
                        <li>Enjoy life</li>
                        <li>Cooking</li>
                        <li>Playing Videogames</li>
                    </ul>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>